msgid "Ryuuji「It's been a long time since I last heard＿that. This guy and that guy say＿ouchie～♪ I used to sing that a lot in」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hace mucho que no oía eso.＿Este y aquel dicen ¡ay, ayayay!～♪＿Lo cantaba mucho en la」"

msgid "Ryuuji「elementary school.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「primaria.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I freaked out when the tickets＿blew away, but you saved our asses,＿Inko-chan. I'm proud to be your owner.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, me asusté cuando los boletos＿volaron, pero nos salvaste el pellejo,＿Inko-chan. Me enorgullece ser tu dueño.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, when you like someone it＿aches...... Aches? I see, love and＿heartache are two sides of the same」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, cuando alguien te gusta duele......＿¿Duele? Ya veo, ¡el amor y el dolor＿son dos caras de la misma」"

msgid "Ryuuji「coin......! Amazing. That's amazing,＿Inko-chan!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「moneda......! Increíble. ¡Eso＿es increíble, Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're right. There's no way you＿could have ever fallen in love when＿you've been stuck in this cage the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes razón. No hay forma de＿que hayas podido enamorarte estando＿atrapado en esta jaula todo el」"

msgid "Ryuuji「whole time...... Forgive me for my＿insensitive question.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tiempo...... Perdóname por mi＿pregunta tan insensible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You speak French now? I guess you＿were fine, then...... Yasuko can get＿things done when she puts her mind to」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ahora hablas francés? Supongo que＿estuvieron bien...... Yasuko logra＿hacer las cosas cuando pone empeño en」"

msgid "Ryuuji「it, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「ello, supongo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're right. Regardless of whether＿she's wise or not, the most important＿thing is that she's alive and well.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Tienes razón. Sea sabia＿o no, lo más importante es＿que está viva y sana.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Exactly!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Exacto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did you say \"just pick one\"? In Kansai＿dialect......? Actually, it's unlike＿anything I've heard before. Is it some」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Dijiste \"elige uno\"? ¿En dialecto＿de Kansai......? No suena a nada que＿haya oído antes. ¿Será algún」"

msgid "Ryuuji「kind of new accent?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tipo de acento nuevo?」"
